Subject: [PATCH] prfAdv promotion resolution edit LE-gate30: ETT docstring
 tracks the new proof (G30-01)

Gate 30 finding G30-01 (minor, documentation): the docstring of ETTGame.prfAdv_eq_expect
(EncryptThenTag/Reduction.lean) still said the identity was "re-derived here in general form
from the published readers" and kept the old rewrite-chain sketch, although the proof is now the
promoted TCSlib.Cryptography.prfAdv_eq_expect. The PRFGame overlap note (prfAdv_prfReduction)
is kept as provenance without the claim of a local derivation, and the sketch now says the lemma
is a direct specialization of TCSlib.Cryptography.prfAdv_eq_expect to Fm and A'.

Docstring only: no code, statement or header change.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01PqpVTiuDcjSqhyfbqnsVxA
